WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.212
Executive Summary.

00:00:02.162 --> 00:00:08.725
579 unique lobbying instances mapped to the Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs.

00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:13.750
CIJA lobbied 56 percent of sitting Canadian Members of Parliament.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:23.025
The network complexity makes manual traversal mathematically impossible — this is an NP-HARD graph problem requiring computational analysis.
